{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
LZ4_STATIC_LINKING_ONLY_DISABLE_MEMORY_ALLOCATION : Disable relatively high-level LZ4/HC functions that use dynamic memory allocation functions (malloc(), calloc(), free()).\par
Note that this is a compile-time switch. And since it disables public/stable LZ4 v1 API functions, we don't recommend using this symbol to generate a library for distribution.\par
The following public functions are removed when this symbol is defined.{
